   "summary": "<figure><img src=\"https://img.huxiucdn.com/ai/ai-general-cover/202610/29/41093-prod-nb2qn-general-1-1793260553063.png?imageView2/1/w/1440/h/810/|imageMogr2/strip/interlace/1/quality/85/format/png\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></figure>常言道“家家有本难念的经”，一向吃喝不愁的欧洲汽车供应链圈近两年似乎也没有余粮了。大陆集团把汽车业务拆成Aumovio敲钟上市，采",
